# Backend API base URL (no trailing slash).
#
# Local `npm run dev`: VITE_API_URL is ignored for API calls (same-origin + Vite proxy → 127.0.0.1:5221).
# To call a remote API from localhost, set VITE_API_URL_FORCE=1 (requires CORS on the API).
#
# Production (Vercel / riseflow.com): keep VITE_API_URL empty so `/api/*` goes through the same-origin
# hosting rewrite/proxy. This avoids cross-site auth-cookie issues during sign-in.
#
# Only set VITE_API_URL to the Railway host if you intentionally want direct cross-origin calls:
# VITE_API_URL=https://riseflowtech-backend-production.up.railway.app
VITE_API_URL=
# VITE_API_URL_FORCE=
